  "id": "idrive_hud_widgets",
  "title": "Apex HUD",
  "description": "Gear, shift lights, boost, oil, coolant and intake temperatures, a G-meter and trip figures on the windshield HUD; Redline (shift lights and shift score) in Sport. Starts with the car.",
